SUMMARY
=======

This repository combines material under three different licences:

  1. Original source code (the wizard `aml-starter-kit-v{version}.html`, the
     standalone helper HTML pages, build/maintenance scripts) — released under
     the MIT License reproduced below.

  2. Vendored third-party JavaScript libraries in `vendor/` (excluding
     `vendor/templates/`) — each distributed under its own permissive licence
     (MIT or BSD-2-Clause). See the THIRD-PARTY LIBRARIES section.

  3. The AUSTRAC starter-kit document templates bundled in
     `vendor/templates/` (44 .docx files + the `manifest.json` recording
     their provenance) — released by AUSTRAC under the Creative Commons
     Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0). See the AUSTRAC
     CONTENT section.

The MIT License below applies only to category 1 (the original source code).
The .docx templates in `vendor/templates/` are NOT MIT-licensed; the licence
that applies to them is CC BY 4.0 as described in the AUSTRAC CONTENT
section.

