DISCLAIMER
==========

See `DISCLAIMER.md` for the full project disclaimer, including the
tipping-off offence (AML/CTF Act s 123) and the limitation that this tool
does not decide compliance, verify customer identity, screen sanctions or
PEPs, monitor transactions, file SMR/TTR/IFTI/CBM reports, or enrol the
practice with AUSTRAC Online.
